OL,5,G0855 Find It, Fix It, Flog It
OL,6,     FSimon O'Brien and Max McMurdo meet
OL,7,     Fretired haulier Jim in
OL,8,     FWorcestershire. Max wants to
OL,9,     Ftransform old air tanks into a
OL,10,     Fsports car, while Simon turns some
OL,11,     Fbarrels into a bar bench.
OL,12,G1000 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FA loo with a view provides cause
OL,14,     Ffor concern, as former art dealers
OL,15,     FRobin and Brenda kick off the
OL,16,     Fcompetition at Causilgey Manor in
OL,17,     FTruro, Cornwall.
