OL,5,G1135 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe final visit is to The Buckle
OL,7,     FSeaford in East Sussex, where B&B
OL,8,     Fnewbies Julie and Jason push the
OL,9,     Fboat out with seaside luxe. And
OL,10,     Fthe guests are blown away by the
OL,11,     Fbedrooms.
OL,12,G1210 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,14,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet
OL,15,     Ffor the last time. There are
OL,16,     Faccusations and awkward moments as
OL,17,     Fthe payments are revealed and the
OL,18,     Fwinner is announced.
