OL,9,     FMabie glampsite in Dumfries. But
OL,10,     Fwill a trek to the toilet poo-poo
OL,11,     Ftheir chances?
OL,12,G1620 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe third visit takes the B&Bers
OL,14,     Fto Jo and Craig's Dale View B&B in
OL,15,     FCumbria, where they all marvel at
OL,16,     Fthe local scenery aboard a steam
OL,17,     Ftrain and bond over bevvies in the
OL,18,     Fboozer.
