OL,5,G1650 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FA giant sloth serves gin to the
OL,7,     FB&Bers as Gig and Lyndsey host the
OL,8,     Ffinal visit at their West
OL,9,     FYorkshire B&B, The Cross Inn. But
OL,10,     Fis it all just for show, or do
OL,11,     Fthey always go all-out?
OL,12,G1720 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FWith sore feelings festering from
OL,14,     Ffoul feedback throughout the week,
OL,15,     Fit's certain to be a dramatic
OL,16,     Fpayment day. After a healthy
OL,17,     Fdollop of debate, who'll win the
OL,18,     Fweek?
